# Feature: control plane (server, db, adapters, plugins)

## Layout

- `server/src/index.ts` — start: config, embedded Postgres, migrate, HTTP, websocket, heartbeat, plugins
- `server/src/app.ts` — Express factory, `/api`, optional `server/ui-dist`
- `server/src/middleware/auth.ts` — `actorMiddleware` (board | agent | none)
- `server/src/routes/authz.ts` — `assertCompanyAccess`, `assertBoard`, `assertInstanceAdmin`
- `server/src/services/heartbeat.ts` — 9720-line orchestration hub; change with extreme care
- `server/src/services/requestService.ts` — issues/requests
- `server/src/services/budgets.ts` — policies, incidents, pause, `getInvocationBlock`
- `server/src/adapters/registry.ts` — adapter type map
- `packages/db/src/schema/` — Drizzle; civic names alias Paperclip tables
- `packages/shared/` — types, Zod, `API_PREFIX = "/api"`

## Auth

- `local_trusted`: loopback, implicit board user in `authUsers`
- `authenticated`: Better Auth sessions; bootstrap invite; council/board claim
- Agents: hashed `agent_api_keys` or local JWT; must not cross `companyId`

## Checkout (known defect)

`POST /issues/:id/checkout` (`server/src/routes/issues.ts`) does not call `assertCompanyAccess`.  
`requestService.checkout` updates by id only; ignores expected statuses.  
`assertCheckoutOwner` returns `{ adoptedFromRunId: null }`.

Any fix must: gate company access, conditional UPDATE, 409 on conflict, activity log, tests for races and cross-company keys.

## Adapters

Registered: process, http, claude_local, codex_local, cursor, gemini_local, opencode_local, pi_local, openclaw_gateway, cloudflare_workers_ai.  
Stub: acpx_local (throws). Listed but unregistered: hermes_local.  
Unknown types fall back to process.

New adapter: follow `.agents/skills/create-agent-adapter/SKILL.md` and register in `registry.ts` + `AGENT_ADAPTER_TYPES`.

## Plugins

Full host despite V1 spec “out of scope”: `packages/plugins/sdk`, server `plugin-*.ts` services, UI slots in Sidebar. Spec: `doc/plugins/PLUGIN_SPEC.md`.

## Workers parity

`workers/api` is a Hono subset. Missing vs Express includes routines, adapters, environments, issue-tree-control, instance DB backups. Hosted-only: collaborate, public-auth, me.

## Change checklist

1. Schema in `packages/db` (+ `packages/db-cloudflare` if hosted)
2. `pnpm db:generate`
3. Shared types/validators/API paths
4. Service + route + `assertCompanyAccess` + activity log
5. UI client in `apps/landing/src/admin/api/`
6. Tests under `server/src/__tests__/` (and landing if UI)
